---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['caroline-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Caroline County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Caroline County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Trusted Legal Representation in Caroline County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Caroline County, the only Eastern Shore county without direct access to the Chesapeake 
    Bay, is a predominantly agricultural community centered around Denton. Known for its 
    farmland, the Choptank River, and small-town atmosphere, residents facing legal 
    challenges deserve experienced representation. Attorney Alex Poberesky serves Caroline 
    County clients with dedication and skill.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Caroline County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Caroline County's agricultural economy brings unique workplace hazards, from farm 
    equipment accidents to injuries at processing facilities. Route 404 carries significant 
    beach traffic during summer months, increasing accident risks. We help injury victims 
    throughout the county.
  </p>
  
  <p>Our Caroline County personal injury practice includes:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Routes 404, 313, and 480</li>
    <li>Truck accidents, including agricultural vehicles</li>
    <li>Farm equipment and agricultural accidents</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries at food processing facilities</li>
    <li>Boating accidents on the Choptank River</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Caroline County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Criminal charges in Caroline County require experienced legal defense. Whether you're 
    facing DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, or other criminal matters, we will fight 
    to protect your rights and achieve the best possible outcome.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Committed to Caroline County Clients</h3>
  
  <p>
    Our firm brings over 26 years of legal experience to Caroline County clients. We travel 
    to Denton and throughout the county to meet with clients and appear in court. Every 
    client receives the personalized attention their case deserves.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Caroline County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Caroline County, including Denton, Federalsburg, 
    Greensboro, Ridgely, Preston, Goldsboro, and surrounding areas. Contact us today 
    for a free consultation about your personal injury or criminal defense case.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
